🧠 Core Architecture Recap
 
plaintext
  
Workflow Fails → Collect Logs/Artifacts → Classify Failure →
  → Rerun (Transient/Network) → Stop+Report (Syntax/Perms/Tests) →
  → Generate Diagnostic Report → Optional AI Auto-Fix
 
 
✅ GitHub Native: Uses  gh run rerun --failed --debug  +  workflow_run  events
✅ Safety Guard: Max 3 retries → Prevents infinite loops
✅ Smart Classification: Only reruns recoverable failures
✅ Permissions: Least-privilege ( actions: write  only)
 
 
 
